{"id":"671671625","kind":"article","title":"从 0 开始学外语：Refold 路线图（详细版）","author":"Refold","original_authors":["Refold"],"original_source_urls":["https://refold.la/roadmap"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"外语习得","date":"2023-12-12","updated":"2024-01-20","votes":758,"comment_count":25,"minutes":2,"chars":879,"keywords":["Refold","二语习得","沉浸式学习","词句挖掘","口语练习","语言学习规划"],"summary":"Refold 路线图按准备与打基础、沉浸理解、口语输出和超越流利等阶段组织课程，逐阶段概述目标、工具及语法词汇、理解、词句挖掘和输出练习。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/671671625","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"阶段 0：Refold 哲学"},{"id":"sec-2","level":3,"title":"0A：方法"},{"id":"sec-3","level":3,"title":"0B：心态"},{"id":"sec-4","level":3,"title":"0C：核心活动"},{"id":"sec-5","level":2,"title":"阶段 1：建立基础"},{"id":"sec-6","level":3,"title":"1A：配置好工具，养成好习惯"},{"id":"sec-7","level":3,"title":"1B：学习基础知识"},{"id":"sec-8","level":3,"title":"1C：快速启动你的理解力"},{"id":"sec-9","level":2,"title":"阶段 2：建立理解"},{"id":"sec-10","level":3,"title":"2A：克服难度陡坡"},{"id":"sec-11","level":3,"title":"2B：拓宽你的领域"},{"id":"sec-12","level":3,"title":"2C：精通理解"},{"id":"sec-13","level":2,"title":"阶段 3：学会说话"},{"id":"sec-14","level":3,"title":"3A：为输出做准备"},{"id":"sec-15","level":3,"title":"3B：刻意练习"},{"id":"sec-16","level":3,"title":"3C：开口说话"},{"id":"sec-17","level":2,"title":"阶段 4：超越流利"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"sec-1\">阶段 0：Refold 哲学</h2><p data-pid=\"EF_H--t_\">在你踏上语言学习之旅之前，你得做好准备。本节将介绍整个旅程中你将使用的方法、心态和工具。</p><ul><li data-pid=\"pc_ShcZ5\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"652924395\" href=\"#/post/652924395\">从这里开始</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-2\">0A：方法</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"rup2pWTE\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"653395751\" href=\"#/post/653395751\">0A1：语言习得</a></li><li data-pid=\"NJmn8Sfb\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"653627979\" href=\"#/post/653627979\">0A2：路线图概述</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-3\">0B：心态</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"uBQU4Ley\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"653844085\" href=\"#/post/653844085\">0B1：享受语言</a></li><li data-pid=\"AJdgrspn\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"653975316\" href=\"#/post/653975316\">0B2：容忍模糊感</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-4\">0C：核心活动</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"-aYHO872\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"654514099\" href=\"#/post/654514099\">0C1：主动沉浸</a></li><li data-pid=\"YE4YJrRn\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"654732187\" href=\"#/post/654732187\">0C2：被动收听</a></li><li data-pid=\"8VAnx10z\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"654942774\" href=\"#/post/654942774\">0C3：主动非沉浸学习</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-5\">阶段 1：建立基础</h2><p data-pid=\"-B2I5Vhy\">建立沉浸学习的技能、工具和习惯，通过学习目标语言的基本语法和词汇来快速启动你的理解力。</p><ul><li data-pid=\"ivRXV_2v\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"655249907\" href=\"#/post/655249907\">阶段 1：建立基础</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-6\">1A：配置好工具，养成好习惯</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"3yQkWMfj\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"655336329\" href=\"#/post/655336329\">1A1：主动沉浸</a></li><li data-pid=\"CF77S9Tt\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"655681003\" href=\"#/post/655681003\">1A2：养成被动收听习惯</a></li><li data-pid=\"kMyqnoSb\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"656108063\" href=\"#/post/656108063\">1A3：Anki 初级配置教程</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-7\">1B：学习基础知识</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"-2iQ3mnC\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"656617074\" href=\"#/post/656617074\">1B1：发音规则</a></li><li data-pid=\"SRgQaYeT\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"656815471\" href=\"#/post/656815471\">1B2：书写系统</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-8\">1C：快速启动你的理解力</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"85_AgZz8\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"657706984\" href=\"#/post/657706984\">1C1：语法</a></li><li data-pid=\"qc4W9QID\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"657926894\" href=\"#/post/657926894\">1C2：SRS 最佳实践</a></li><li data-pid=\"jyj_9jq_\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"657926906\" href=\"#/post/657926906\">1C3：词汇</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-9\">阶段 2：建立理解</h2><p data-pid=\"jWjhUxCw\">直接从沉浸中学习，直到你完全理解。</p><ul><li data-pid=\"U-Zg3qdo\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"658600512\" href=\"#/post/658600512\">阶段 2：建立理解</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-10\">2A：克服难度陡坡</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"t2wnKigQ\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"659801550\" href=\"#/post/659801550\">2A1：领域</a></li><li data-pid=\"j2_IDfpN\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"659997950\" href=\"#/post/659997950\">2A2：可理解性的影响因素</a></li><li data-pid=\"RoDU_9tW\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"660191182\" href=\"#/post/660191182\">2A3：可理解性的媒体类型索引</a></li><li data-pid=\"x9JIHaEM\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"660585871\" href=\"#/post/660585871\">2A4：理解等级</a></li><li data-pid=\"7_mt9Bt5\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"661001618\" href=\"#/post/661001618\">2A5：主动沉浸的类型</a></li><li data-pid=\"-VtoFDzb\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"661668624\" href=\"#/post/661668624\">2A6：沉浸学习指南</a></li><li data-pid=\"j47IBFuv\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"661468923\" href=\"#/post/661468923\">2A7：基础词句挖掘</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-11\">2B：拓宽你的领域</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"yDc7zb-Z\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"662319968\" href=\"#/post/662319968\">2B1：沉浸学习指南</a></li><li data-pid=\"ta9hfy1X\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"662953967\" href=\"#/post/662953967\">2B2：高级词句挖掘</a></li><li data-pid=\"JSmp8GR-\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"663375434\" href=\"#/post/663375434\">2B3：自然单语过渡</a></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-12\">2C：精通理解</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"7aK2hDlL\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"663991638\" href=\"#/post/663991638\">2C1：沉浸学习指南</a></li><li data-pid=\"Dkd-mDg6\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"664609463\" href=\"#/post/664609463\">2C2：纯听力（选修）</a></li><li data-pid=\"pwzigyvE\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"665212298\" href=\"#/post/665212298\">2C3：如何阅读小说（选修）</a></li